This Fedora package combines two licenses, matching upstream
https://github.com/ftoleedo/px13-audio-fix:

  * Kernel module (module/tas2783-sdw.c, module/tas2783.h):
    GPL-2.0-only, derived from the Linux tas2783 SoundWire driver
    (Texas Instruments / kernel authors).

  * Packaging files, helper scripts, and documentation in this
    repository: CC0-1.0. See LICENSE.upstream for the original CC0
    notice from ftoleedo/px13-audio-fix.

  * ALSA UCM fragments in configs/ follow their respective upstream
    projects.

The full CC0 text is at:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The GPL-2.0 text is at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html
